<noinclude>
Profile on a player's own user page, such as User:Mira. Create it with [[Form:Player]].
Its Cargo row is what the Player and Game master pickers list, so drafts such as User:Mira/Notes never appear there.
Only the root user page stores a row. Characters and campaigns are worked out by [[Module:Campaign]].

